Chapter VIII - Repeal and Other Provisions | A. Repeal and Saving | With the issue of these Directions, the existing Directions, instructions, and guidelines relating to Cybersecurity Framework and IT Governance as applicable to Commercial Banks stand repealed, as communicated vide circular no. DoS.CO.PPG.66/11.01.005/2026-27 dated July 31, 2026. The directions, instructions, and guidelines repealed prior to the issuance of these Directions shall continue to remain repealed.

